  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato and bamboo shoots (see ingredients) into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place potato, bamboo shoots and peeled & chopped pumpkin on a lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat. Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the veggies between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6510dfb59706eaeddf635176-61f3c2d6.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, drain and rinse chickpeas.\n• Finely chop brown onion and garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6510dfb59706eaeddf635176-871f17fd.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook onion, stirring, until softened, 3-4 minutes.\n• Add garlic, tomato paste, chermoula spice blend and chickpeas and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6510dfb59706eaeddf635176-51e9af44.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the water, coconut milk, vegetable stock powder and the brown sugar. Stir to combine, bring to a simmer, then cook until slightly reduced, 3-5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6510dfb59706eaeddf635176-2f704300.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove saucepan from the heat. Add roasted veggies and baby spinach leaves, gently stirring until combined.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6510dfb59706eaeddf635176-142b854f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide chermoula chickpea and coconut soup between bowls.\n• Sprinkle with chilli flakes (if using) and tear over coriander to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6510dfb59706eaeddf635176-c37bf229.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
